I have updated the **Members** tab to explicitly label the main action as **"Add New Member"** instead of "Add Family". I also updated the form headers and search placeholders to be more generic ("Member Information" instead of "Head of Family"), making it clear that you can add single individuals as well as families.

Here are the changes:

