I have updated the **Members** component to improve the editing experience, specifically for **Family Members**.

You can now:
1.  **Edit Family Members**: Inside the member modal, you can now click a **Pencil icon** next to a spouse or child to modify their details (Name, DOB, Relationship) instead of having to delete and re-add them.
2.  **UX Improvement**: Added a clear message for non-Admin users (Guests/Board Members) explaining that "Edit/Add" capabilities are restricted to the **Admin** role, helping avoid confusion about missing buttons.

This respects the "Admin Only" rule while making the data management much smoother.

