This resolves the "client is offline" and "refused to connect" errors by removing the dependency on the invalid Firebase configuration. The app will now "work like before," allowing you to register, login, and save songs immediately without needing API keys.

**Note:** If you wish to use Firebase in the future, you will need to add your valid API keys to `firebaseConfig.ts` and then request to "Switch to Firebase".

